# Enterprise Identity Verification Platform — Project Documentation

## 1. Project Overview

Ye ek AI-powered Enterprise Identity Verification Platform hai jo KYC (Know Your Customer) verification ko automate karta hai. System multiple AI modules ko combine karke ek unified Trust Score deta hai, saath mein har decision ka explainable reasoning — aur ek Knowledge Graph + LLM-powered Copilot ke through fraud investigation ko support karta hai.

